From 63f915173d8fc533ca548d0de5b25f41b1db8b9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keunhong Park <keunhong@codeaurora.org>
Date: Mon, 6 Aug 2012 15:49:42 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Plugin for multi-master support

Add interface and implementation necessary for Gerrit to run in
multi-master mode. The implementation provided uses UDP messages with
ACKs to send and receive evict notices.

Peers are registered and checked using a shared git repository (under
refs/meta/cluster/ in All-Projects.git).

 Current Progress
  - Git ref peer registry works
  - UDP messaging (Evict notices, ACKS etc.) works
  - UDPPacemaker is implemented and used (cache is flushed if an active
    peer is outdated)

Change-Id: I1dc0fd50f12ffbb7c8cabe512d221f35bcf00a09
